	<text xml:lang="la">
		<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" subtype="metadata" n="1">Wenige Tage vor <persName ref="p8011" cert="high">Gwalthers</persName> Brief vom 4. März; vgl. unten <ref target="file11278">Nr. 1235</ref>, 2-4 und 7-10.</note>
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a domino etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi literas tuas<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Nicht erhalten.</note>, Moecenas<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Vgl. oben <ref target="file11260">Nr. 1217</ref>, Anm. 3.</note> humanissime, quibus et <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>tuam et praesidum nostrorum sententiam intellexi, cui ego obediens <placeName ref="l558">Vitembergam</placeName> adire <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nunquam instituam; hoc enim nunc unicum curo, ut vobis vestrisque mandatis<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>vor</hi> mandatis <hi>ein gestrichener Buchstabe.</hi></note> satis<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>facere possim.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Cur autem hoc mihi negatum sit, satis manifeste, ut videtur, video <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>neque hęc iniquo animo fero, cum vos iam eius aetatis esse eamque rerum experi<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>entiam habere sciam, ut, quid agendum sit, multo melius me discernere possitis.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Divulgavit autem <placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName> rumorem quendam <persName ref="p5072">Sebastianus</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Gemeint ist vielleicht <persName ref="p5072">Sebastian Guldibeck</persName>.</note> noster, qui dixit hoc <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>decretum a nostris esse, ut nullus nostri collegii alumnus <placeName ref="l558">Witembergam</placeName> petat.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Quod num ita se habeat, vęhementer miror.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quis nunc rerum mearum status <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>sit, paucis sic accipe: Cum <placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName> sumptus mihi intollerabiles esse <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>viderem nec ipsorum<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>vor</hi> ipsorum <hi>gestrichenes</hi> ill.</note> victus valetudini meae percommodus esset, <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>redii et a d. <persName ref="p8418">Miconio</persName> magna cum humanitate receptus sum.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l378">Parisiorum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>schola (cuius tu mentionem feceras) meis opibus est incommoda.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Qui nam <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ii sint, nescio, qui 12 coronatis victum promittunt; omnes sane, quos ego <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>conveni, mensam vix minoris vęnire aiunt quam 25 coronatis.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Multa <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>praeterea in cubiculum lectumque insumenda, nisi forte hi putant in collegio <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quodam mihi vivendum esse; quod si fecero, singulis diebus missa <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>audienda est, quod ego nunquam faciam, etiamsi gratis mihi darentur omnia; <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>animę enim salutem pecuniarum cumulis pretiosiorem aestimo.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quare <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>optimum mihi videtur <placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName> aliquandiu manere, nisi aliter tibi vi<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>sum fuerit, cuius consilium ego semper mihi ut certissimam Cyno<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>suram<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Leitstern (vgl. <bibl source="b7">HBBW V</bibl> <ref target="file10642">[Nr. 604]</ref>, S. 258, Anm. 29).</note> propono.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Te rogo, ut, quae in rem meam sint, consulas.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Hoc unum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>autem summis votis abs te oro, ut in hoc apud nostros incumbas, ne reditus <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>mei consilia<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>korrigiert aus</hi> consilii.</note> captent; huius etenim mentionem in tuis feceras literis.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Concedite, quaeso, ut aliorum more etiam ego inter exteros bonas artes perdiscere <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>queam.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Sed de his multis agere supervacaneum esse duco etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/><persName ref="p8459">Otho</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p8459">Otto Werdmüller</persName>.</note> noster, ut spero, brevi publice <persName ref="p4543">Ciceronis</persName> orationes praeleget<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Vgl. oben <ref target="file11265">Nr. 1222</ref>, 9-11.</note>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Quare te <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>obsecro (patrone amantissime), ut <persName ref="p4543">Ciceronis</persName> opera<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>korrigiert aus</hi> Ciceronem meum.</note>, si modo fieri potest, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>hisce <placeName ref="l157">Frankfordianis</placeName> nundinis<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Zum Termin der <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurter</placeName> Frühjahrsmesse vgl. oben <ref target="file11260">Nr. 1217</ref>, Anm. 1.</note> ad me mittas<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Bereits am 4. Oktober 1538 hatte <persName ref="p8011">Gwalther</persName> darum gebeten; s. <bibl source="b10">HBBW VIII</bibl> <ref target="file11227">[Nr. 1184]</ref>, S. 239, 17-20.</note>; quibus, si poteris, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>adde, quęso, locorum communium librum, quem Eliotus mihi dono dedit<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p1001">Nicholas Eliott</persName> hatte <persName ref="p8011">Gwalther</persName> 1537 einen von ihm selbst begonnenen Zitatenschatz geschenkt, den <persName ref="p8011">Gwalther</persName> weiterführte ("Thesaurus variae lectionis ex prophanis et sacris scriptoribus", Zürich ZB, Ms D 2).</note>.<pb type="edition" next="69"/></s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Novi, quod scribam, non habeo, nisi quod, cum <placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> discederem, comitia<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Zum <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurter</placeName> Bundestag vgl. oben <ref target="file11273">Nr. 1230</ref>, Anm. 4.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z32"/><placeName ref="l157">Frankfordiae</placeName> fuerunt, quibus <persName ref="p19065">Saxoniae dux</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Kurfürst <persName ref="p19065">Johann Friedrich von Sachsen</persName>.</note> interfuit.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Turcarum vires <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>omnes metuunt, quod <placeName ref="l1725">Salzburgensis</placeName> quidam mercator<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Unbekannt.</note> in itinere <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>mihi narravit, cum simul pernoctaremus.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandus</persName> interim (<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>ut ipse narrabat) ad hęc colludit; alii principes et episcopi populum <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>magis deglubunt quam tuentur.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/><placeName ref="l830">Angliae</placeName> <persName ref="p8375">regi</persName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><persName ref="p8375">Heinrich VIII.</persName></note> <persName ref="p18538">cęsar</persName><note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> <persName ref="p20225">Gallusque</persName><note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16"><persName ref="p20225">Franz I.</persName></note> bellum <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>minitari dicuntur<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17"><persName ref="p8011">Gwalther</persName> gibt hier eine von <persName ref="p315">Bedrot</persName> geäußerte Befürchtung wieder; vgl. dessen undatierten Brief an <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> in Zürich ZB, Ms F 80, 44. Zu den Gerüchten um einen Feldzug gegen <placeName ref="l830">England</placeName> s. <hi>Prüser,</hi> <placeName ref="l830">England</placeName> 149-151.</note>.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Quod num verum sit, ignoro.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Si verum est, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>stultissimum cęsar molitur facinus, qui tot hostibus, quos iam habet, etiam <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>alium sibi parare conatur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p6431">Vitrico</persName><note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="18"><persName ref="p8011">Gwalthers</persName> Stiefvater <persName ref="p6431">Sebold Schleusinger (Schlüßinger)</persName>, gest. 1560, von <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>, war wohl ein Nachkomme des Stadtarztes <persName ref="p6430">Eberhard Schleusinger</persName> (vgl. <bibl source="b291">HBLS</bibl> VI 197). 1523 gehörte er dem <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Predigerkonvent an. 1525 heiratete er <persName ref="p20426">Adelheid Glattfelder</persName>, <persName ref="p8011">Gwalthers</persName> verwitwete Mutter, 1533 in zweiter Ehe <persName ref="p6429">Agnes Wolf</persName> (vgl. <bibl source="b10">HBBW VIII</bibl> <ref target="file11193">[Nr. 1150]</ref>, S. 177, Anm. 5). - Lit.: Martina <hi>Wehrli-Johns,</hi> Geschichte des Zürcher Predigerkonvents (1230-1524). Mendikantentum zwischen Kirche, Adel und Stadt, Zürich 1980, S. 256.</note> meo misi <placeName ref="l834">Italicarum</placeName> cucurbitarum <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>semina; hic, ubi excreverint, etiam tuę <persName ref="p8051">uxori</persName><note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="19"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> (si modo voluerit) <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>de his impartietur, nam hac illi conditione hęc misi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Plura, <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>quae scribam, non habeo.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Tu, quaeso, hęc mea aequi bonique consule.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>, ex aedibus <persName ref="p8418">Miconii</persName>, 1539.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutato, quaeso, nomine meo <lb xml:id="p1z45"/><persName ref="p7042">matrem</persName><note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="20"><persName ref="p7042">Anna, geb. Wiederkehr</persName>.</note> et uxorem tuam cum universa familia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z46"/>Tui observantissimus <lb xml:id="p1z47"/><persName ref="p8011">Rod. Gvalterus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Vere docto et pio viro M. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Moecenati suo imprimis <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>colendo.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>An M. <persName ref="p495">Heinrich Bullinge<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>r</persName>, predicanten <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>zuͦ <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>, sinem günstigen <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>herren.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
